---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import schema from '../data/schema/solution.json';
---
<Layout
  title="Solutions: AI Video, LMS & PowerPoint to SCORM | Flipick"
  description="Flipick offers three AI products: an AI video studio for marketing and L&D, a skills-development LMS, and a PowerPoint-to-SCORM course converter."
  keywords="AI video solutions, LMS platform, PowerPoint to SCORM, eLearning solutions, AI learning technology, enterprise learning platform, AI video studio, skills development platform"
  page="solutions-overview"
  schema={schema}
>
  <main>

    <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
    <section class="hero hero--compact">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-grid hero-grid--lg">
        <span class="eyebrow">Solutions</span>
        <h1 class="hero-h1--sm">One company. <span class="serif-i text-brand-mid">Three ways to put AI to work.</span></h1>
        <p class="sub">Flipick is a learning-technology company building AI across the whole arc of content &mdash; from cinematic video, to a full skills platform, to a pipeline that turns your existing decks into deployable courses. Pick the one you need, or use them together.</p>
        <div>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" data-demo-link href="https://calendly.com/amol-chandsarkar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a demo</a>
        </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= ABOUT FLIPICK ================= -->
    <section class="section-white section-pad-sm" aria-label="About Flipick">
    <div class="lwrap">
        <div class="fcard rv" style="border-left:4px solid var(--brand);padding:1.25rem 1.75rem;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto">
        <span class="eyebrow">Flipick in brief</span>
        <p style="margin-top:.5rem;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7">Flipick is an AI video and learning platform serving L&amp;D, marketing and customer education teams. It combines three products: an <strong>AI Video Studio</strong> (create, distribute and prove video end to end, including Variable Video Production); an <strong>AI Skills LMS</strong> (zero-hallucination RAG assistant, adaptive assessments, Singapore Skills Framework integration); and a <strong>PowerPoint-to-SCORM pipeline</strong> (send a deck, get back a deployable course in 15 days). Customers include Pearson, Godrej, IIBF, Jindal Steel and IFC World Bank Group.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:1rem;display:flex;gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.875rem">
            <span><strong>Have content to create?</strong> &rarr; <a href="/ai-video-platform">AI Video Platform</a></span>
            <span><strong>Need to host &amp; track courses?</strong> &rarr; <a href="/lms">LMS G2</a></span>
            <span><strong>Have PowerPoint slides?</strong> &rarr; <a href="/ppt-to-scorm">PPT to SCORM</a></span>
        </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= AI VIDEO PLATFORM ================= -->
    <section class="section-pad-card">
    <div class="lwrap">
        <div class="sol-card sol-card--brand">
        <div class="fcard split rv">
            <div class="fcard-txt">
            <span class="eyebrow">AI Video Platform &middot; Flagship</span>
            <h2>Cinematic video you create, personalize and prove.</h2>
            <p>Studio-grade AI video for marketing, L&amp;D and customer teams &mdash; built like a studio, not a slot machine, and measured end to end.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>A studio pipeline: screenplay &rarr; storyboard you approve &rarr; finished film, with your brand and cast consistent across every scene</li>
                <li>Personalize one master film into hundreds of versions with Variable Video Production (VVP) &mdash; no re-shooting</li>
                <li>Deliver and prove: authenticated views, completion and CTA tracking</li>
                <li class="geo-cloak" data-inr="Priced in credits — 1 credit = ₹1, pay for what you make and distribute" data-usd="Priced in credits — 1 credit = $0.01 (1¢), pay for what you make and distribute">Priced in credits &mdash; 1 credit = &#8377;1, pay for what you make and distribute</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/ai-video-platform">Explore AI Video Platform &rarr;</a>
            </div>
            <div class="fcard-media">
            <div class="sol-img-wrap">
                <img src="/assets/images/solutions/video-builder.webp" alt="AI Video Platform &mdash; cinematic studio output" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="logostrip rv">
            <span class="lbl">Trusted by</span>
            <div class="logorow">
            <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/IIBF_logo.webp" alt="IIBF" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= FLIPICK LMS ================= -->
    <section class="section-pad-card">
    <div class="lwrap">
        <div class="sol-card sol-card--teal">
        <div class="fcard split rev rv">
            <div class="fcard-txt">
            <span class="eyebrow">Flipick LMS &middot; AI skills platform</span>
            <h2>Not just an LMS. An AI skills-development platform.</h2>
            <p>AI across the whole learning lifecycle &mdash; content creation, engagement, assessment and analytics &mdash; aligned to real industry roles.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Knowledge-grounded AI assistant with citations &mdash; zero hallucination, built for regulated training</li>
                <li>Adaptive, GMAT-style assessments and personalised learning pathways</li>
                <li>Skills-framework alignment (SSF), learner-to-role mapping and talent-gap analytics</li>
                <li>Generate question banks and full courses from your own material</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/lms">Explore Flipick LMS &rarr;</a>
            </div>
            <div class="fcard-media">
            <div class="sol-img-wrap">
                <img src="/assets/images/solutions/LMS-Solution.webp" alt="Flipick LMS &mdash; AI skills development platform" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="logostrip rv">
            <span class="lbl">Trusted by</span>
            <div class="logorow">
            <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/Pearson_logo.webp" alt="Pearson" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/logo_elsevier.svg" alt="Elsevier" width="58" height="65" loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/Clarivate_Logo.webp" alt="Clarivate" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/PI-horizontal-logo.webp" alt="PI Industries" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= POWERPOINT TO SCORM ================= -->
    <section class="section-pad-card">
    <div class="lwrap">
        <div class="sol-card sol-card--amber">
        <div class="fcard split rv">
            <div class="fcard-txt">
            <span class="eyebrow">PowerPoint &rarr; SCORM &middot; Production pipeline</span>
            <h2>Turn the decks you already have into live courses.</h2>
            <p>Send a PowerPoint, PDF or policy document and get back a fully animated, narrated, assessed, SCORM-ready course &mdash; in about 15 days.</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Four steps, ~15 days: send your source &rarr; AI pipeline &rarr; human QA &rarr; deploy to your LMS</li>
                <li>Scenario training, adaptive assessments and personalised paths built in</li>
                <li>Source-locked and human-reviewed &mdash; every word traceable to your document</li>
                <li class="geo-cloak" data-inr="Productised pricing in INR, from ₹1,50,000 per course" data-usd="Productised pricing from $1,800 per course">Productised pricing in INR, from &#8377;1,50,000 per course</li>
            </ul>
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/ppt-to-scorm">Explore PowerPoint &rarr; SCORM &rarr;</a>
            </div>
            <div class="fcard-media">
            <div class="sol-img-wrap">
                <img src="/assets/images/solutions/PPT-to-Scorm-Solution.webp" alt="PowerPoint to SCORM &mdash; content conversion pipeline" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy">
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="logostrip rv">
            <span class="lbl">Trusted by</span>
            <div class="logorow logorow-5">
            <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/IIBF_logo.webp" alt="IIBF" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/jindal-steel.webp" alt="Jindal Steel" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/logo_godrej.webp" alt="Godrej" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/IFC-WBG.webp" alt="IFC World Bank Group" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
            <div class="logoslot"><img src="/assets/images/customers/logo_iica.webp" alt="IICA" width="1200" height="380" loading="lazy"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= NOT SURE WHICH FITS? ================= -->
    <!-- ================= FAQ ================= -->
    <section id="faq" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head rv sec-head--center sec-head--mb-md">
        <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
        <h2>Common questions about <span class="serif-i text-brand">Flipick solutions.</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq rv">
        <details open>
            <summary>What products does Flipick offer?</summary>
            <p>Flipick offers three products: the AI Video Platform for marketing, L&amp;D and customer teams; Flipick LMS, an AI skills-development platform; and PowerPoint to SCORM, which converts existing decks into SCORM-ready eLearning courses.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>What is Variable Video Production (VVP)?</summary>
            <p>Variable Video Production turns one master film into hundreds or thousands of personalised variants, rendered from your data so every viewer gets a version that fits them.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>What is PowerPoint to SCORM?</summary>
            <p>It converts PowerPoint, PDF or Word source material into fully animated, narrated and assessed SCORM-ready courses in approximately 15 days, with every element derived from your source documents.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
            <summary>How is Flipick priced?</summary>
            <p>Flipick uses transparent credit-based pricing: 1 credit = ₹1 (or $0.01 in USD). There are no seats and no subscriptions. The AI video base rate is 3,300 credits per finished minute.</p>
        </details>
        </div>
    </div>
    </section>

    <section class="closing" aria-label="Call to action">
    <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Not sure which fits? <span class="serif-i">Let&rsquo;s figure it out together.</span></h2>
        <p>Tell us the outcome you&rsquo;re after &mdash; on-brand video at scale, a smarter LMS, or converting a backlog of decks &mdash; and we&rsquo;ll map the right Flipick solution to it.</p>
        <div class="ctas-center">
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" data-demo-link href="https://calendly.com/amol-chandsarkar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a demo</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    </section>

    </main>

  <script is:inline slot="scripts" src="/assets/js/video-player.js"></script>
</Layout>